+1.  $\mathbf{D}$: A $3 \times 3$ symmetric positive-definite diffusion tensor at a specific voxel location.
+2.  $\mathbf{v}$: A normalized direction vector ($\|\mathbf{v}\| = 1$) along which the diffusion is to be measured.
 
